  "description": "A greybox dev and test room for the element rules (mw-e03.54), reached with ?scene=chaos-room. A 24 m by 16 m hall with four spaced stations along the north side: fire (crates, a haystack, an oil barrel and an unlit brazier), wet (a water trough and two dry crates), freeze (an ice block, two crates and a puddle) and charge (an iron anvil, a crate and barrel and a puddle). Along the south wall six crates stand 3 m apart for the identification playtest (put each in a different state and ask what it is). The middle of the hall is left open for combo scenarios, with a pressure plate and a chandelier on a rope. Every object is spaced so fire in one cannot reach another.",
